    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bienvenid<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa. Te estaba esperando.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690065006E00760065006E0069006400100003110000FF0101006F0061002E00200054006500200065007300740061006200610020006500730070006500720061006E0064006F002E00100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mademoiselle Lilette te espera, así que debes\ndirigirte al área de combate de la Sociedad de<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nCombates de Luminalia cuanto antes.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 136
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Algún problema? Solo debes bajar las\nescaleras.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nY, como ya sabes, mademoiselle Lilette no\nsoporta que la hagan esperar.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 128
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0004>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00040000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>, querid<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000002C002000710075006500720069006400100003110000FF0101006F0061002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "No sabes lo agradecida que estoy de que hayas\npedido que se celebren los Juegos Z-A Infinitos<U+0010><U+0001>븀\ncomo deseo por haber alcanzado el rango A.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 144
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me hizo tan feliz que decidí organizar mi\npropio torneo. Lo llamé...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D0065002000680069007A006F002000740061006E002000660065006C0069007A002000710075006500200064006500630069006400ED0020006F007200670061006E0069007A006100720020006D0069000A00700072006F00700069006F00200074006F0072006E0065006F002E0020004C006F0020006C006C0061006D00E9002E002E002E00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Torneo Lilette Suprême S!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10054006F0072006E0065006F0020004C0069006C00650074007400650020005300750070007200EA006D006500200053002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Tienes alguna idea de qué significa esa <U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0001>S<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>,\nquerid<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoa?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 11,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005400690065006E0065007300200061006C00670075006E00610020006900640065006100200064006500200071007500E90020007300690067006E006900660069006300610020006500730061002000100002FF000001005300100002FF000000002C000A00710075006500720069006400100003110000FF0101006F0061003F00100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Sublime?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005300750062006C0069006D0065003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Satisfactorio?",
