      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004D00610067006E00ED006600690063006F0021002000A10041007300ED002000650073002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Claro, como el sabor de la victoria!\n¡Pero no, no me refiero a eso!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10043006C00610072006F002C00200063006F006D006F00200065006C0020007300610062006F00720020006400650020006C006100200076006900630074006F0072006900610021000A00A1005000650072006F0020006E006F002C0020006E006F0020006D00650020007200650066006900650072006F00200061002000650073006F002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Esto es un torneo \"solo\" para nosotr<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿāoas dos!\n¡Tú contra mí! ¡El Torneo Lilette Suprême S!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aunque me venzas... ¡tendrás que volver a\nenfrentarte a mí!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410075006E0071007500650020006D0065002000760065006E007A00610073002E002E002E002000A100740065006E0064007200E10073002000710075006500200076006F006C00760065007200200061000A0065006E006600720065006E00740061007200740065002000610020006D00ED002100100002011400150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y, además, ¡podrás seguir desafiándome tantas\nveces como quieras! Ganes o no el torneo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 92
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Te quedó todo claro?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0015>",
